<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-SANITAS REGISTERS BIG BLOCK TRADE.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-SANITAS REGISTERS BIG BLOCK TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's stock exchange said on Thursday that a block trade of shares in pharmaceutical producer Sanitas worth 33.5 million litas was registered at 96 litas per share.</p>
<p>Dealers said around 50 percent of the firm was sold but could not say who bought or sold the shares.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
